  "schematicNotes": [
    {
      "id": "n1",
      "schematicPosition": {
        "x": 330,
        "y": 1300
      },
      "text": "Center Cluster harness - Cowork 2026-09-27. Wires to labeled pins only. J8 pinout SoT: center-cluster-esp32-p4/PINOUT.md + docs/datasheets/waveshare-esp32-p4-xc-j8-silkscreen.png. CAN H/L not drawn here. Flash center board via 'USB TO UART' port only (Enc3 on GPIO24/25). Dupont 2.54 housings at boards; encoders/ODO are generic parts; buck, CAN transceiver, opto are screw terminals; splices are plain wire-to-wire joins. Two CHASSIS GND ring terminals = same stud.",
      "width": 390
    }
  ],
